{"id":"256220eba4eba968","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-computation.md","title":"Finite Turing-Machine Computation","display":"df-computation — Finite Turing-Machine Computation","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-df-computation","aliases":["28-df-computation"],"display":"df-computation — Finite Turing-Machine Computation","depends_on":["[[28-df-tm]]","[[28-df-ntm]]","[[28-df-configuration]]","[[28-df-configuration-transition]]"],"source_status":"statement-compared-local-formalization","source_printed_pages":"13,80","source_pdf_pages":"39,106"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-computation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-computation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-computation — Finite Turing-Machine Computation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1965e2b0765554c9\" href=\"?note=1965e2b0765554c9\" title=\"28-df-tm\">28-df-tm</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e6357334ccd3589d\" href=\"?note=e6357334ccd3589d\" title=\"28-df-ntm\">28-df-ntm</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"599727eea07e91d7\" href=\"?note=599727eea07e91d7\" title=\"28-df-configuration\">28-df-configuration</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"6b648ff230619ba2\" href=\"?note=6b648ff230619ba2\" title=\"28-df-configuration-transition\">28-df-configuration-transition</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_status","html":"statement-compared-local-formalization"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"13,80"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"39,106"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}})\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\cup\\mathrm{NTM}\">\\(M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}})\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\cup\\mathrm{NTM}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\{0,1\\}^*\">\\(x\\in\\{0,1\\}^*\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k=k_M\">\\(k=k_M\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Conf}(M,x),I_x\">\\(\\operatorname{Conf}(M,x),I_x\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Step}_M\">\\(\\operatorname{Step}_M\\)</span> 来自 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"599727eea07e91d7\" href=\"?note=599727eea07e91d7\" title=\"28-df-configuration\">28-df-configuration</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"6b648ff230619ba2\" href=\"?note=6b648ff230619ba2\" title=\"28-df-configuration-transition\">28-df-configuration-transition</a>。\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho=(C_0,\\ldots,C_m)\">\\(\\rho=(C_0,\\ldots,C_m)\\)</span> 为非空有限配置序列，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{len}(\\rho)=m\">\\(\\operatorname{len}(\\rho)=m\\)</span> 表示转移步数，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{last}(\\rho)=C_m\">\\(\\operatorname{last}(\\rho)=C_m\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C.q\">\\(C.q\\)</span> 为配置的状态投影。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"B(j)\\coloneqq\\sqcup\\quad(j\\in\\mathbb N),\\qquad C_{M,x}^{0}\\coloneqq\\langle q_0,(I_x,B,\\ldots,B),(0,\\ldots,0)\\rangle.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[B(j)\\coloneqq\\sqcup\\quad(j\\in\\mathbb N),\\qquad C_{M,x}^{0}\\coloneqq\\langle q_0,(I_x,B,\\ldots,B),(0,\\ldots,0)\\rangle.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Comp}_M(x)\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{m\\in\\mathbb N}\\{(C_0,\\ldots,C_m)\\in\\operatorname{Conf}(M,x)^{m+1}\\mid C_0=C_{M,x}^{0}\\land\\forall j&lt;m\\;\\operatorname{Step}_M(C_j,C_{j+1})\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Comp}_M(x)\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{m\\in\\mathbb N}\\{(C_0,\\ldots,C_m)\\in\\operatorname{Conf}(M,x)^{m+1}\\mid C_0=C_{M,x}^{0}\\land\\forall j&lt;m\\;\\operatorname{Step}_M(C_j,C_{j+1})\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{AccComp}_M(x)\\coloneqq\\{\\rho\\in\\operatorname{Comp}_M(x)\\mid\\operatorname{last}(\\rho).q=q_{\\mathrm{acc}}\\},\\qquad L(M)\\coloneqq\\{x\\in\\{0,1\\}^*\\mid\\operatorname{AccComp}_M(x)\\ne\\varnothing\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{AccComp}_M(x)\\coloneqq\\{\\rho\\in\\operatorname{Comp}_M(x)\\mid\\operatorname{last}(\\rho).q=q_{\\mathrm{acc}}\\},\\qquad L(M)\\coloneqq\\{x\\in\\{0,1\\}^*\\mid\\operatorname{AccComp}_M(x)\\ne\\varnothing\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Halt}_M(x)\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists b\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall\\rho\\in\\operatorname{Comp}_M(x)\\;(\\operatorname{len}(\\rho)\\le b).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Halt}_M(x)\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists b\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall\\rho\\in\\operatorname{Comp}_M(x)\\;(\\operatorname{len}(\\rho)\\le b).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>非确定机所有分支有限且有限分支时，König 引理保证逐输入存在统一长度界；此处 Halt 明确采用所有分支停机的约定。各工作带从空白开始，输入串只出现在只读带。</p>\n<p>来源：所给 Arora–Barak PDF，§1.2，印刷 p.13 / PDF p.39；§4.1 Remark 4.3，印刷 p.80 / PDF p.106。已核对本项所述原文；集合/元组编码是本目录的显式实现约定。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-tm","status":"resolved","id":"1965e2b0765554c9","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-tm]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-ntm","status":"resolved","id":"e6357334ccd3589d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-ntm]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-configuration","status":"resolved","id":"599727eea07e91d7","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-configuration]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-configuration-transition","status":"resolved","id":"6b648ff230619ba2","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-configuration-transition]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-configuration","status":"resolved","id":"599727eea07e91d7","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}})\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\cup\\mathrm{NTM}$，$x\\in\\{0,1\\}^*$，$k=k_M$；$\\operatorname{Conf}(M,x),I_x$ 与 $\\operatorname{Step}_M$ 来自 [[28-df-configuration]]、[[28-df-configuration-transition]]。\n$\\rho=(C_0,\\ldots,C_m)$ 为非空有限配置序列，$\\operatorname{len}(\\rho)=m$ 表示转移步数，$\\operatorname{last}(\\rho)=C_m$；$C.q$ 为配置的状态投影。","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-configuration-transition","status":"resolved","id":"6b648ff230619ba2","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}})\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\cup\\mathrm{NTM}$，$x\\in\\{0,1\\}^*$，$k=k_M$；$\\operatorname{Conf}(M,x),I_x$ 与 $\\operatorname{Step}_M$ 来自 [[28-df-configuration]]、[[28-df-configuration-transition]]。\n$\\rho=(C_0,\\ldots,C_m)$ 为非空有限配置序列，$\\operatorname{len}(\\rho)=m$ 表示转移步数，$\\operatorname{last}(\\rho)=C_m$；$C.q$ 为配置的状态投影。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}})\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\cup\\mathrm{NTM}","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in\\{0,1\\}^*","display":false},{"tex":"k=k_M","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Conf}(M,x),I_x","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Step}_M","display":false},{"tex":"\\rho=(C_0,\\ldots,C_m)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{len}(\\rho)=m","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{last}(\\rho)=C_m","display":false},{"tex":"C.q","display":false},{"tex":"B(j)\\coloneqq\\sqcup\\quad(j\\in\\mathbb N),\\qquad C_{M,x}^{0}\\coloneqq\\langle q_0,(I_x,B,\\ldots,B),(0,\\ldots,0)\\rangle.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Comp}_M(x)\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{m\\in\\mathbb N}\\{(C_0,\\ldots,C_m)\\in\\operatorname{Conf}(M,x)^{m+1}\\mid C_0=C_{M,x}^{0}\\land\\forall j<m\\;\\operatorname{Step}_M(C_j,C_{j+1})\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{AccComp}_M(x)\\coloneqq\\{\\rho\\in\\operatorname{Comp}_M(x)\\mid\\operatorname{last}(\\rho).q=q_{\\mathrm{acc}}\\},\\qquad L(M)\\coloneqq\\{x\\in\\{0,1\\}^*\\mid\\operatorname{AccComp}_M(x)\\ne\\varnothing\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Halt}_M(x)\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists b\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall\\rho\\in\\operatorname{Comp}_M(x)\\;(\\operatorname{len}(\\rho)\\le b).","display":true}],"bytes":2061,"backlinks":[{"id":"9efd20f439611336","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"c7bfa0375f35877e","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$M\\in\\mathrm{TM}$，$L\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^*$；$L(M),\\operatorname{Halt}_M$ 来自 [[28-df-computation]]。"},{"id":"343af549f6fb6f36","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}$；固定有限转移表编码 $\\eta:\\mathrm{NTM}\\hookrightarrow\\Sigma^*$，有效码可在码长多项式时间识别并解码；$\\mathrm{NTM},\\operatorname{AccComp}_M(x),\\operatorname{len}(\\rho)$ 见 [[28-df-ntm]]、[[28-df-computation]]。"},{"id":"4382c6bdd7033833","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$s:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}$；工作空间及所有分支停机来自 [[28-df-machine-resources]]、[[28-df-computation]]。"},{"id":"9ed6fa1ce1934897","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$t:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}$；$\\operatorname{time}_M,L(M)$ 来自 [[28-df-machine-resources]]、[[28-df-computation]]。"},{"id":"01678cd990532be9","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"机器有效编码与元组编码见 [[28-df-godel-numbering]]；$\\operatorname{AccComp}_M,\\operatorname{len}$ 见 [[28-df-computation]]；$M\\in\\mathrm{TM}$。"},{"id":"89e240fe2a8a5b0c","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}$；$\\ulcorner M\\urcorner$ 与有效二串配对编码见 [[28-df-godel-numbering]]；$\\operatorname{Halt}_M(x)$ 见 [[28-df-computation]]。"},{"id":"b5d4fc2d291ce98b","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}})\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\cup\\mathrm{NTM}$，$x\\in\\{0,1\\}^*$，$k=k_M$。计算前缀 $\\rho=(C_0,\\ldots,C_m)\\in\\operatorname{Comp}_M(x)$，$C_t=\\langle q_t,T^t,\\boldsymbol i^t\\rangle$，see [[28-df-computation]]。\n$\\overline{\\mathbb N}=\\mathbb N\\cup\\{\\infty\\}$；上确界取于此序集，有限字串以下标 $0$ 起始。\n$\\uparrow\\notin\\{0,1\\}^*$。$\\operatorname{out}(T)$ 对每个有限非空白支撑的工作带 $T:\\mathbb N\\to\\Gamma$ 定义；$M(x)$ 的机器输出仅对确定型 $M$ 定义。输出为该带从第 $0$ 格起的最大二进制前缀。"},{"id":"54da139362531e67","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"7514d356710d2e51","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{NTM}$、$L(N)$ 与 $\\operatorname{time}_N(x)\\in\\mathbb N\\cup\\{\\infty\\}$ 分别见 [[28-df-ntm]]、[[28-df-computation]]、[[28-df-machine-resources]]；时间是所有计算前缀步数的上确界。"},{"id":"91b637dbdbd7a2c3","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}})\\in\\mathrm{TM}$，$k=k_M$；初始配置 $C^0_{M,x}$ 见 [[28-df-computation]]，一步关系 $\\operatorname{Step}_M$ 见 [[28-df-configuration-transition]]。$q(C)$、$i_j(C)$ 分别为配置的状态和第 $j$ 个头位置投影；$0\\le j\\le k$。下式按 $t\\in\\mathbb N$ 定义停机后吸收延拓的执行和头位置函数。"},{"id":"3e7207510b515565","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$x\\in\\{0,1\\}^*$，$C,C'\\in\\operatorname{Conf}(M,x)$；$C^0_{M,x}$ 见 [[28-df-computation]]。"},{"id":"b75200f005282ddf","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$N=(M_0,M_1)$ 为两台共享 $Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,q_0,q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}}$ 和带数、仅转移函数可不同的确定型机。$\\operatorname{Step}_{M_b}$、初始配置 $C^0_{M_0,x}$ 分别见 [[28-df-configuration-transition]]、[[28-df-computation]]；$C.q$ 是状态投影，$C.T_1$ 是输出工作带投影，$\\operatorname{out}$ 见 [[28-df-machine-resources]]。$\\mathsf{RTM}$、$C_t^N$、$T_N$、$O_N$ 由下式定义。"},{"id":"e21780e838b68217","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$M\\in\\mathrm{TM}$，$L\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^*$；$L(M)$ 来自 [[28-df-computation]]。"},{"id":"ed85cd72838ef590","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}})\\in\\mathrm{TM}$，$k=k_M$，见 [[28-df-tm]]。$\\operatorname{Conf}(M,x)$、$\\operatorname{Step}_M$、$C^0_{M,x}$、$\\operatorname{out}$ 依次见 [[28-df-configuration]]、[[28-df-configuration-transition]]、[[28-df-computation]]、[[28-df-machine-resources]]。"},{"id":"e7acf5d437592730","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"cb0c882121f853e4","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}$；机器有效编码与可解码元组编码来自 [[28-df-godel-numbering]]；四元组采用 $\\langle a,b,c,d\\rangle=\\langle a,\\langle b,\\langle c,d\\rangle\\rangle\\rangle$；$\\operatorname{AccComp}_M,\\operatorname{len}$ 见 [[28-df-computation]]；$n,t\\in\\mathbb N$，$1^0=\\varepsilon$。"},{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"语言与停机语义：[[28-df-language]]、[[28-df-decider]]、[[28-df-recognizer]]、[[28-df-tm]]、[[28-df-ntm]]、[[28-df-configuration]]、[[28-df-configuration-transition]]、[[28-df-configuration-graph]]、[[28-df-computation]]。"},{"id":"ab29eca0895539ff","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"486528342e0c392b","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}$；$\\operatorname{ser}_{\\mathrm{TM}}$ 是 [[28-df-godel-numbering]] 固定的可计算、可判定值域机器序列化；$M_0\\in\\mathrm{TM}$ 为恒拒绝机。$L(M)$ 见 [[28-df-computation]]。"}],"outgoing":["1965e2b0765554c9","e6357334ccd3589d","599727eea07e91d7","6b648ff230619ba2"]}